      ],
      "source": "https://www.hsoy.org/brief-history-of-old-yarmouth",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1640, Mattacheese had been renamed Yarmouth after a seaside town in England, and 28 families settled.",
